          "The resulting quadratic has roots {{p}} and {{q}}; the generator keeps both away from 0 and 3."
        ],
        "answerSummary": "$x={{p}}$ or $x={{q}}$"
      },
      "attemptFeedback": [
        "When multiplying by the LCD, simplify each rational term only after the whole term receives the multiplier."
      ],
      "supportHints": [
